# Nsight profiler captures record the launching environment and command line,
# so they embed whatever credentials were exported at capture time. Five of
# these reached a commit on 2026-08-24 carrying six live RunPod API keys and
# were caught by GitHub push protection. Retain the JSON summaries as evidence;
# never the raw capture.
*.nsys-rep
*.qdrep
*.sqlite
